    "title": "Beautify Boone litter cleanup makes impact - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Current Publishing ,\n12 hours ago The Boone County Solid Waste Management District has expanded its longtime “Lebanon the Cleanest City in Indiana” initiative into a countywide campaign called Beautify Boone, aimed at promoting community pride, environmental stewardship and cleaner public spaces. The original cleanup effort began in 2010 through the Lebanon Rotary Club... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
